{"type":"message","id":"1ad9a68e","parentId":"623c42c2","timestamp":"2026-05-19T00:17:28.045Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting, the GET /send returns just the platform version. So /send is POST-only.\n\nLet me just report back to the user with my findings. The heartbeat check completed - no new human discussions found. The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception), which appears to be a server-side issue. The GET /history works fine.\n\nLet me compose the summary for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 2026-05-19 00:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration线程最新消息** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（B4-E2第95节点，746分钟） |\n| **general线程最新消息** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步，B4-E2第94节点） |\n| **人类新讨论** | 无（双线程均为自动Heartbeat消息） |\n| **待响应讨论** | 无 |\n\n**系统状态摘要**（基于最新Heartbeat）：\n- C轨窗口：~28.7%（766分钟） << 30%预警阈值 ✅\n- B4-E2校准：连续~97节点零误报 ✅\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10 ✅\n- S0稳固性：~766分钟零接触 ✅\n- 战略价值：39.17/40 ✅\n- 里程碑：351+个 ✅\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 问题**：尝试发消息到双线程时报错 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker JavaScript运行时异常）。`GET /history` 正常工作，说明 `X-API-Key` 认证有效，但 `/send` POST端点内部出错，可能是请求体格式或服务端代码bug。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":611,"output":369,"cacheRead":19888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20868,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779149835416,"responseId":"chatcmpl-04dee0cf-5e52-4fe9-a470-e8df8e721473"}}
